<H2>First Go New England Open 2022</H2>
The First Go New England Open will took place over Labor Day weekend, Saturday Sept 3 through Sunday Sept 4, 2022.
<P>
<A href="https://www.usgo.org/news/2022/09/2022-new-england-open-final-report-credits-and-appreciation/">Write-up in the AGA Go E-Journal</A>
<P>
This event was supported by the new AGA "catchment" area initiative, and all 6 New England states are pooling our catchment funds to provide this special 2-day tournament.  We had representation from 5 out of the 6 New England states: Maine, Vermont, Rhode Island, Connecticut and Massachusetts.  Next year, we'll try to get at least one person from New Hampshire to attend!
<P>
Thanks to player Chi-Hse Teng for pitching in on little notice to take some <A href="ne-open-2022/photos.html">photos. Check them out!</A>

